<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.47 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.47 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.47 percent in the week ending November 9 from 6.48 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES    Nov 9, 1996   Nov 2, 1996  Nov 18, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.47	   +6.48	   +6.63</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.1	   318.6	   299.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended November 18, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
